{"id":"nunca","lemma":"nunca","pos":"adv","rank":77,"glosses":["never","ever"],"ipa":"/ˈnunka/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ae/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-nunca.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tú casi nunca trabajas, ¿verdad?","en":"You hardly ever work, do you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/642309","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"almost"},null,{"g":"to work","l":"trabajar"},{"g":"truth"}]},{"text":"¿Has dicho que yo no podría ganar nunca?","en":"Did you say that I could never win?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/609574","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"saying, expression"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to gain"},null]},{"text":"Nunca me harías hacerlo, ¿verdad?","en":"You'd never make me do that, would you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/506575","words":[null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"truth"}]},{"text":"No te he visto nunca.","en":"I never saw you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/128116","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"seen"},null]},{"text":"Nunca me dejes ir.","en":"Never let me go.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589691","words":[null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to leave","l":"dejar"},{"g":"to go"}]}]}